      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t it be called out/ dir?\n\"gen/\" dir is already used as the out directory of a gen_rule module.\n\"out/\" dir is currently used in some rust packages to store manually pre-generated source files, to replace cargo output and OUT_DIR.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "418910c10fdb200e33e9add41d03b44e42bb18bb",
