      "message": "Could this be set only for modules with such need defined in Android.bp? Most rustc invocations do not need it.\nFor implementation, it would be nice to generalize this and allow any env variable-value pair to be specified in Android.bp and defined for rustc. Also when necessarily use a name different from OUT_DIR.",
